{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This cycle has destroyed most people. But can you be the one to break it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can\u2019t You Run?</strong> is a psychological horror game where escape is just an illusion. Trapped in an ever-shrinking, haunted space, you must collect essential items to survive. But no matter how many times you try, true escape remains just out of reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>An Unrelenting Loop:</strong> Every attempt pushes you deeper into an endless cycle of fear and desperation.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>A Dark and Oppressive Atmosphere:</strong> Light is your only ally, but even it won\u2019t save you.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Strategic Survival:</strong> Gather weapons and supplies through multiple levels, preparing for the ultimate test.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>A Deadly Final Challenge:</strong> Reach the final stage, where nightmarish creatures await. Are you truly ready?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hand-holding, no second chances. <strong>You can run, but not forward.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3618470?t=1747919173","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3618470?t=1747919173","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618470/e6cc469b983dcb91490555cbdb586ee77f84b994/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747919173","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618470/e6cc469b983dcb91490555cbdb586ee77f84b994/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747919173","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains elements of gunfights and horror."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This cycle has destroyed most people. But can you be the one to break it?</p><p c